   - Two bodies with two flat colors: dark cup #7c4a26 and light dry twigs #d6b184.
     Largest channel gap 0.35, so the paint rule draws each twig outline.
   - Eleven twigs: one rim ring, four climbers with round ends past the lip, three wall twigs,
     two low braces, one twig across the cup floor.
   - Vertex colors: texture false, paintWeight 1. No atlas, so no smeared texels and no seam.
   - Eggs #8fd3f0 with a light top #aadff7, so they read light blue in the row light.
   - Soft variation under 0.09 in every region, so no paint edge fires inside a region.
